WEBVTT

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:16.370
Sheesh, Shino, I can handle shopping by myself.

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:21.570
T-Take these with you!

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:26.410
She always treats me like a child.

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:28.250
Huh?

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:36.090
Aya? What are you doing?

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:37.390
Alice!

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:39.070
<i>Did she see me?</i>

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:42.670
I-I'm not Aya! I'm a mannequin!

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:23.300
I just thought I'd try standing
like a cool young lady.

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:25.580
Episode 4
Rain or Shine

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:24.620
Why?

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:27.360
Well, yesterday, when some
middle schoolers mistook me

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:29.420
for a mannequin, I was really shocked.

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:31.910
That happens to me all the time.

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:33.920
I had no idea it happened to you, too.

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:37.050
We have the same problem.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:38.910
We have so much in common.

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:41.380
Hey, then why don't we

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:43.550
become delinquents together?

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:44.180
What?

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:46.010
W-Wait a minute.

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:47.340
Why delinquents?

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:50.350
I'm trying to become more of a mature woman...

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:52.690
Isami told me the other day.

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:57.940
Isami, you've always seemed so grown-up.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.160
What's your secret?

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.450
Well...

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:07.400
Maybe I seem that way because

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:09.330
I'm not a "good girl" like all of you.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:13.060
If that's what she said, it must be true!

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:14.220
Exactly!

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:18.140
Morning.

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:19.770
It's hot today, isn't it?

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.950
G-Good morning, Karasuma-sensei.

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:31.080
Good morning, Kuzehashi-sensei.

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:33.280
Have you gotten used to Class A yet?

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:35.940
Yes. They're all very good kids.

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:37.320
But...

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:39.960
I'm always wondering how I can be

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:42.380
a model teacher to my students.

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:44.820
Don't worry about that.

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:48.370
You set a great example for
the kids just as you are.

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:51.230
No, I still have a long way to go!

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:54.190
I need to work even harder to reinvent myself.

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:58.050
<i>This year, I'll make my students like me.</i>

00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:00.180
<i>I'll be nice to everyone.</i>

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:06.230
What are they doing?

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:08.350
How am I supposed to handle that?

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:15.810
Alice and Aya have gone bad...

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:17.760
What happened to them?

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:20.660
Are they trying to be delinquents?

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:22.450
It's kinda cute.

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:25.660
There, there.

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:28.940
There, there. There, there, there.

00:04:29.610 --> 00:04:31.200
Would you like a banana?

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.540
Am I a wild animal?!

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:34.780
G—

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.040
G—

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:38.690
Grrr!

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:40.050
She took it!

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:43.250
Maybe they're trying to tell us something.

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:45.430
You know, like rebellious youths...

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:48.350
I used to want to be a delinquent,

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:50.560
and I don't think they've got it quite right.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:55.990
This is what a delinquent looks like!

00:04:55.990 --> 00:04:58.560
I'm not sure that's right, either.

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:02.470
I'm going to go break the school's windows!

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:03.820
Kujou-san...

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:06.000
Why only me?!

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:07.270
Stop right there!

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:08.960
You're not getting away with this!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:17.120
We did our best to look like delinquents,
but I don't think she gets it.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.330
I wonder why.

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:20.360
Is it because I have black hair?

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:21.840
I'm blonde.

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:24.420
Blonde is your natural color.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:27.290
Wouldn't that mean dying it black

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:29.580
would make you a delinquent?

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:31.850
Oh, right. We can try that.

00:05:34.550 --> 00:05:35.680
Hey!

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:42.080
<i>Th-That's unusual. Shino's mad?</i>

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:43.570
<i>She even said "hey"...</i>

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:48.540
Alice, how could you say that?!

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:51.240
I didn't raise you to be like that!

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.840
Shino...

00:05:53.570 --> 00:05:55.750
You didn't raise me.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:57.680
Forget it!

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:04.670
Over such a stupid reason...

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:07.140
Class 2-C Schedule

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:10.060
You can't call that a fight.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:13.010
Why did this happen?

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:17.980
What have I done?

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:23.030
I'm sorry! It's probably my fault!

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:25.160
I shouldn't have said that to her!

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:28.490
Why did you want to be delinquents?

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:29.280
Huh?

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:33.810
Good question. Why did we?

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:37.230
We didn't really want to be delinquents.

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:40.790
We lost sight of our goal somewhere along the way!

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:45.760
At times like these,
you should apologize right away.

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:48.100
Let's go do it during our next break.

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:49.390
Karen...

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:50.800
Okay.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:57.680
Huh? Alice left as soon as class ended.

00:06:58.170 --> 00:07:01.150
I thought she went to make up with you.

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:02.580
We missed her?

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.690
Did she run away from home?

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:07.350
You don't think she went
back to England, do you?

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:08.820
What?!

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:19.300
<i>I'll give Shino a drink and apologize.</i>

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:21.260
Alice!

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:24.690
Alice!

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:27.320
I'm sorry!

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:32.430
I'd love you even if you weren't blonde!

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:35.350
I'm sorry for always thinking
of you as a little animal!

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:38.680
I'm sorry for thinking of us as
fellow flat-chested comrades!

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:43.230
I'm the one who broke the
vase at your house!

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:47.730
Alice, please come out!

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:50.230
Alice!

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:51.980
Where are you?

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:58.380
Really? You never told me that before.

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.500
Alice!

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:07.380
I heard you were worried
about seeming childish.

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:10.000
You're growing.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:12.080
I think you've gotten taller, too.

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:13.060
Really?

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:16.820
Yes. You're way more brilliant than last year.

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:17.890
Your hair is, I mean.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.190
Shino!

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:23.400
I want to be more like you.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:25.840
Oh, Alice...

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.600
Trying to be like someone you know?

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:30.000
That's not a bad idea.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.370
Aya, you should try to be more like me.

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:34.600
Just kidding.

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:35.810
Maybe I should.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.140
A-Aya's being honest!

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:41.410
She's a tsundere-dere!

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:42.660
Tsundere-dere?!

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:47.240
Someday, I'll be as tall as you. Just wait!

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:48.170
Okay.

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:52.140
Try and catch me!

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:53.340
What the heck is this?

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.680
Give me back my textbook!

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.350
<i>A role model, huh?</i>

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:01.750
<i>I wonder who mine is.</i>

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:10.690
Today is the pearl anniversary...

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:12.990
Stare...

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:16.480
Kuzehashi-sensei, is Karasuma-sensei
your role model?

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:18.630
H-How did you know?!

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:26.210
Well, I'm glad you made up.

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:26.960
Yeah.

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:30.310
By the way, it looks like you've gotten used

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:32.590
to not being Shino's classmate anymore.

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:36.010
Oh, please. Of course I have.

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:37.470
After all...

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:39.220
There.

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:44.320
I have Shino #2.

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:47.690
Kuzehashi-sensei made it for me.

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:49.830
Kusshi-chan...

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.190
You shouldn't have done that...

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:56.450
Okay, take your seats, every—

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:03.610
An Oomiya-san... hug pillow?

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:05.080
It's just a pillow.

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.200
<i>I need...</i>

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:10.990
<i>to scold her, like a proper teacher.</i>

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:15.390
Alice-san...

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:18.590
You'll fall asleep if you
have a pillow in class!

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:20.340
<i>That's</i> the problem?!

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:25.780
Sensei, I confiscated this.

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:27.180
That's...

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:30.910
I'm sorry. She begged me to make it for her.

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:32.590
I want one!

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:34.850
I understand completely.

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:37.570
I'll be keeping this pillow.

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:40.720
Excuse me.

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:43.450
Snooze...

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:45.650
S-Sensei?!

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:53.400
<i>I can't be too strict or too nice.</i>

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:55.440
<i>Teaching children is hard.</i>

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:58.300
<i>I need to reward and punish
them when appropriate.</i>

00:11:02.450 --> 00:11:05.350
Kujou-san, your stomach is showing!

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:06.400
It's immodest!

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:09.850
Take good care of your stomach.

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:11.660
You're so nice.

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:19.760
But why a pillow?

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:22.490
I wanted something I could squeeze.

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:24.740
What will you do from now on, then?

00:11:23.560 --> 00:11:27.020
<i>Nothing ever came of our talk about</i>

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:27.110
Oh, no! What should I do?

00:11:27.020 --> 00:11:28.500
<i>trying to look more mature.</i>

00:11:27.110 --> 00:11:31.800
How about squeezing me a bunch before class?

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:33.350
You'd be stocking up on Shino.

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:34.790
Stocking up on Shino?

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:38.170
What's wrong, Aya?

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:39.520
I have something to do.

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:41.480
I need to get going now.

00:11:42.270 --> 00:11:43.740
Bye-bye.

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:56.000
Welcome.

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:58.420
E-Excuse me...

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:03.070
Hello!!
Kin-iro Mosaic

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:07.120
Hello!!
Kin-iro Mosaic

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:14.170
<i>We're growing flowers in the flowerbed at school.</i>

00:12:15.590 --> 00:12:18.380
Shino, they're almost ready to bloom.

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:21.380
You're right.

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:25.490
The flowerbed?

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:28.750
Yes. There's a flowerbed in the courtyard

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:30.700
that the Gardening Club used until last year.

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:33.180
Let's plant something there together.

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:35.150
We can plant anything?

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:36.270
Yes.

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:39.750
Then there's something I want to plant.

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:43.960
<i>And now, they've grown this big.</i>

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:48.550
They say plants grow better
when you talk to them.

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:51.080
Let's try it.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.080
Grow bigger.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:57.080
Grow bigger. Grow bigger.

00:12:57.080 --> 00:13:00.940
Totem pole. Totem pole.

00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:01.800
<i>I... I want to join them.</i>

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:02.590
Totem pole...

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:10.950
Mine looks like it's about to wilt.

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:14.220
Oh, my. Maybe you watered it too much.

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:16.690
You gave it too much love.

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:19.570
Gardening is so hard...

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:24.340
Maybe Alice is small because

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:28.100
I give her too much love!

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:29.370
That must be it!

00:13:30.590 --> 00:13:33.870
<i>I feel so conflicted, but for some reason...</i>

00:13:34.380 --> 00:13:36.250
<i>I'm so happy!</i>

00:13:37.470 --> 00:13:40.570
How are my flowers doing?

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:44.010
Your flowers are in full bloom over there.

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:48.560
They're full of life, just like me.

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:51.720
You've barely taken care of them.
How did they grow so well?

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:56.930
I must have given the flowers my energy.

00:13:56.930 --> 00:13:59.980
You can have some, too! Yay!

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:00.900
I'm fine.

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:02.190
Withdraw

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:04.530
If anything, I feel like you're
sucking energy out of me.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.490
What's wrong, Honoka?

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.500
Energy in!

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:18.260
Is this... a magic school in London?

00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:19.250
What?

00:14:20.320 --> 00:14:22.160
Hard at work, are we?

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:23.630
Youko-chan.

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:27.520
You should've planted
something with Aya-chan.

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:31.140
Aya-chan said she was scared of bugs, right?

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:34.890
I'm actually scared of bugs, too.

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:37.800
Youko, does your stomach hurt?

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:39.750
Did you eat something
that disagreed with you?

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:42.650
I was just trying to be cute!

00:14:43.050 --> 00:14:44.950
I prefer food over flowers.

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:46.440
That sounds more like you.

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:49.200
Now that you mention it,
Aya-chan's not here yet.

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:51.490
She said she'd be late, but...

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.760
Ayaya's already here.

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:57.410
K-Karen, don't...

00:14:57.410 --> 00:15:00.710
I'll give you energy, too.

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:03.840
Aya, are you crying?

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:06.690
Is something wrong?
Did something bad happen?

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:07.980
No...

00:15:12.230 --> 00:15:15.430
I cut my bangs too short!

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:17.120
No big deal.

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:18.860
It <i>is</i> a big deal!

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:21.980
Youko, a woman's hair is her life.

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:24.760
But it doesn't even look that different.

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:30.160
Someone teach me how to
grow my hair out faster!

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:33.700
Well, I hear seaweed works for that.

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:35.080
I know!

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:37.690
Flowers grow when you water them.

00:15:37.690 --> 00:15:39.790
Maybe people work the same way.

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:41.420
Of course! Water!

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:42.710
That can't possibly...

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.300
I'll try it!

00:15:44.300 --> 00:15:46.250
She's grasping at straws!

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:53.080
My flowers seem like they're ready to bloom,

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:54.500
so why won't they?

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:57.650
Why don't you just wear your bangs up?

00:15:57.650 --> 00:16:00.700
The leaves look healthy.
I'm sure they'll bloom soon.

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:02.260
You think so?

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:04.530
I want to hide my forehead!

00:16:04.530 --> 00:16:05.760
Really?

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:10.140
Ayaya, it's okay. You have a small forehead.

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:11.670
What does that mean?

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:16.230
Alice, let's head back to the classroom.

00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:17.160
Okay.

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:22.000
Karasuma-sensei,

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:24.840
I heard that you're growing flowers.

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:26.390
Yes.

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:29.000
Would you like to join us?

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:31.240
What? R-Really?

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:34.170
I think flowers would suit you.

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:37.270
B-But they suit you much more!

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:39.780
You have a sort of light, breezy quality...

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:41.770
In particular...

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:45.270
I think pumpkin flowers
would suit you perfectly.

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:46.370
Pumpkin?

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:50.650
Actually, instead of flowers,
I'm raising a home vegetable garden.

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:53.530
The okra are coming up right now.

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:56.150
The school isn't your home...

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:57.910
I got permission to grow them.

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:00.910
I thought you were growing flowers.

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:02.740
Kuzehashi-sensei,

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:07.170
flowers are for admiring,
but okra is for eating.

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:11.230
Do you mind if I use that quote sometime?

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:12.880
Go ahead.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:18.680
Aya, you know our English homework...

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:21.120
Who are you?! That's terrifying!

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:22.810
Huh? It's me, Aya.

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:24.470
Really?

00:17:24.470 --> 00:17:26.910
What does Aya like, then?

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:27.950
L-Like?

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:31.020
Wh-Wh-Why do I have to tell you?

00:17:31.430 --> 00:17:33.920
Oh, good.

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:35.740
Only Aya blushes like that.

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:37.140
Amazing!

00:17:37.140 --> 00:17:39.830
You can tell through the cardboard?

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:43.720
That'll only draw more attention to you.

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:46.770
I thought it was a good idea...

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.710
Okay, then...

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:51.740
We can do this and this...

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:54.630
Now we match!

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:57.430
Hey, that's cute!

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:58.720
It's nice!

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:02.840
You idiot!

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:04.150
Why?!

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:12.670
I hope they're blooming.

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:13.320
Yeah.

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:16.740
Karasu-chan said it's not good to give them

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:18.190
too much water or sunlight.

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:21.200
The tsuyu hasn't started yet,
so the timing should be right.

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.670
"Tsuyu"?

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:24.950
Diluting tsuyu broth with soba
water makes it taste better.

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:26.760
No, Karen...

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:30.830
Japan has something called "tsuyu."
It's when it rains a lot.

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:34.350
Alice, Karen was making a joke.

00:18:34.350 --> 00:18:35.870
You didn't need to tell her that.

00:18:35.870 --> 00:18:38.770
What? You're so mean, Karen!

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:46.030
They're still not blooming.

00:18:46.030 --> 00:18:47.850
Maybe they won't bloom.

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:49.840
It's okay.

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:51.360
They'll bloom tomorrow.

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:55.180
We'll come check tomorrow morning, okay?

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:15.630
Are... Are the flowers okay?

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:21.260
They look fine.

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.500
It might be too strong for them.

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:26.130
Maybe we should protect them from the rain.

00:19:29.090 --> 00:19:34.020
I helped my mum with the
gardening in England, too.

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:44.360
Come to think of it, your family's garden

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:46.460
had a lot of flowers.

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:52.100
Alice's mom is great at baking
scones and growing flowers.

00:19:55.270 --> 00:20:00.990
But I've never been able to make them bloom...

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:06.180
Bloom! Please bloom!

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:06.180
Bloom!

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:07.150
You can do it!

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:20.720
I'm glad the rain stopped before lunch time.

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:22.440
Let's go check on the flowers.

00:20:22.440 --> 00:20:25.120
Yeah, but I don't think...

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:26.550
Alice!

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:39.590
Shino, they're blooming!

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:40.870
Yes!

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:48.310
Now that your flowers are blooming,

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:51.030
I'm going to replant my own.

00:20:51.030 --> 00:20:53.480
You let your own flowers wilt...

00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:56.980
Shino, do you know what
kind of flower this is?

00:20:57.280 --> 00:20:59.760
Yes. It's a marigold, right?

00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:01.740
Yeah, and...

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:05.380
Well, in the language of flowers,

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:06.990
marigolds mean "friendship."

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:10.870
How wonderful.

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:17.210
They can also mean "envy."

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:19.400
What is wrong with you?

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:20.890
Pick up on the mood!

00:22:54.170 --> 00:22:55.720
Did you know, Alice?

00:22:56.100 --> 00:22:58.930
Apparently, there's a type
of pasta called "angel hair."

00:22:58.930 --> 00:23:00.100
Really?

00:23:00.430 --> 00:23:03.860
Come to think of it, shredded omelets
look like blonde hair, too.

00:23:04.090 --> 00:23:06.280
Now that you mention it, you're right.

00:23:07.730 --> 00:23:11.150
Maybe your hair tastes good, too.

00:23:11.150 --> 00:23:13.620
There you go again, Shino.

00:23:14.050 --> 00:23:15.550
Peperoncino...

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:16.620
Pant   Pant   Pant

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:17.870
Pant   Pant   Pant

00:23:17.910 --> 00:23:19.120
Pant   Pant   Pant

00:23:17.950 --> 00:23:20.850
Y-You look serious!

00:23:19.160 --> 00:23:20.370
Pant   Pant   Pant

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:21.170
Pant   Pant   Pant

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:24.170
I'm wearing high heels today!

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:25.630
Ta-da

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:25.750
You look so grown-up.

00:23:25.750 --> 00:23:27.880
Now I'm finally a woman.

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:27.760
Smug

00:23:26.530 --> 00:23:28.290
They make you look taller.

00:23:27.970 --> 00:23:33.890
Whimper

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:31.510
They hurt! I must have sprained my ankles...

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:32.860
They're just blisters.

00:23:32.860 --> 00:23:33.890
What a child...

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:36.220
Come Play with Your Older Sister

00:23:34.340 --> 00:23:36.220
See you next time.
